{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For information and benefits about the game &quot;Photographer Simulator,&quot; Follow Bilibili Channel @\u6708\u4e0b\u591c\u60f3\u66f2JesseMJ  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or join the official QQ group: 628608070. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>StudioManagement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage and expand your photography studio, from opening to closing, with every detail under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/extras/\u7ecf\u84251080p.gif?t=1750643506\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>StreetPhotographyTasks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete various outdoor shooting tasks and specific missions in the pedestrian street to earn money and likes, boosting your shop's popularity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/extras/\u8857\u62cd1080p.gif?t=1750643506\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NPCInteraction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with NPCs on the street, increase favorability by giving gifts and completing tasks, unlocking more features and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/extras/NPC\u6a21\u72791080p.gif?t=1750643506\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PoseDesign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and pose customer shots, adjusting every joint in detail to create unique photography works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/extras/\u59ff\u52bf1080p.gif?t=1750643506\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CustomerPhotoshoots\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve various types of customers, including regular, VIP, and celebrity clients, fulfilling their shooting needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/extras/\u62cd\u64441080p.gif?t=1750643506\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EquipmentUpgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continuously upgrade and add new photography equipment and tools by earning income and completing tasks, improving shooting quality and efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/extras/\u8bbe\u59071080p.gif?t=1750643506\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EmployeeManagement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire staff to help manage your studio, streamlining your workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/extras/\u96c7\u54581080p.gif?t=1750643506\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3098660?t=1750643506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750643506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750643506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750643506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"It does not contain violent content or sexual content,